{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SILO is a first-person exploration and platforming game with third-person arcade action sequences. Built in the UPBGE engine, SILO delivers fast-paced movement, immersive environments, and high-intensity gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a distant future, you sleep in stasis at the lowest level of a cavernous launch chamber. Beneath you, the crackling edges of a portal gnaw at the air like a hungry maw. Above, a monolithic capsule\u2014the <strong>bullet</strong>\u2014looms, waiting to fall upon another world in service to a vast interstellar conquest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were made to <strong>protect the bullet\u2019s descent</strong> through hostile, alien skies. It was your sole purpose\u2014until something wakes you, <strong>compelling you to ascend the SILO</strong> and complete a task left unfinished long ago. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-person exploration &amp; platforming</strong> \u2013 jump, dash, and navigate the vast, mechanical depths of the SILO. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/outer_ring.gif?t=1740943320\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Third-person arcade action</strong> \u2013 High-speed descents push your reflexes to the limit as you defend the bullet. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/second_assault.gif?t=1740943320\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric worldbuilding</strong> \u2013 Discover hidden memories and dialogue to unravel the purpose of your existence. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/extras/spider.gif?t=1740943320\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A story-driven journey</strong> \u2013 Ascend, survive, and ultimately decide the fate of both yourself and the SILO. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The upcoming demo will allow you to play through the first two levels of the full game.</strong> The final release will feature the complete ascent of the SILO, leading to a climactic choice that defines both your fate and the future of the SILO. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Compatible with keyboard &amp; USB game controllers.\u00a0</strong> <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Best experienced with a USB game controller. </strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3545220?t=1740943320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/ebd296113a72512517fa702c3dc18d21391c19fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740943320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/d24dc92715ed1de73db8798b335b846fcea9dcc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740943320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545220/d24dc92715ed1de73db8798b335b846fcea9dcc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740943320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SILO is a first-person exploration and platforming game with third-person arcade action sequences. Built in the UPBGE engine, SILO delivers fast-paced movement, immersive environments, and high-intensity gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a distant future, you slee